{"id":53,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Its elegant and refined behavior clashes with that of the barbaric Perrserker. The relationship between the two is one of mutual disdain."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Getting this prideful Pokémon to warm up to you takes a lot of effort, and it will claw at you the moment it gets annoyed."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"The gem in its forehead glows on its own! It walks with all the grace and elegance of a proud queen."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"This Pokémon is popular with rich people. It’s also targeted by hunters who are after the jewel in its forehead."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Although the jewel on its forehead appears to be a different color than those of Alolan Persian, it’s mostly made of the same material."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It has a high opinion of itself, although not to the same extent as the Alolan Persian. It’s quite difficult to make friends with this Pokémon."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It has a violent temperament. It will attack anything that looks it in the eye. Its sharp claws inflict deep wounds."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Persian has six bold whiskers that give it a look of toughness. The whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in the Pokémon’s surrounding vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"Its lithe muscles allow it to walk without making a sound. It attacks in an instant."},{"games":["X","LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"Although its fur has many admirers, it is tough to raise as a pet because of its fickle meanness."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"A very haughty Pokémon. Among fans, the size of the jewel in its forehead is a topic of much talk."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"Many adore it for its sophisticated air. However, it will lash out and scratch for little reason."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"Has a vicious temperament. Beware if it raises its tail straight up. It is a signal that it is about to pounce and bite."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A PERSIAN’s six bold whiskers sense air movements to determine what is in its vicinity. It becomes docile if grabbed by the whiskers."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Behind its lithe, elegant appearance lies a barbaric side. It will tear apart its prey on a mere whim."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Limber","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's limber body prevents it from being paralyzed."},{"name":"Technician","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up weak moves so the Pokémon can deal more damage with them."},{"name":"Unnerve","hidden":true,"description":"Unnerves opposing Pokémon and makes them unable to eat Berries."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"urban","color":"Yellow","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":52,"name":"Meowth","condition":null,"children":[{"id":53,"name":"Persian","condition":"Lv. 28 or Level up, High Friendship","children":[]},{"id":863,"name":"Perrserker","condition":"Lv. 28","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,408],[1,10],[1,45],[1,252],[1,364],[1,415],[12,6],[16,44],[20,269],[24,372],[31,154],[36,103],[42,163],[48,417],[54,583]],"machine":[332,97,133,34,204,886,399,91,38,283,203,263,313,206,492,416,441,270,63,304,196,282,808,232,417,220,583,408,182,244,240,156,46,402,247,421,806,214,555,180,164,241,129,36,269,851,168,675,87,86,85,885,369],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv6pt5-78","name":"Persian","set":"Shrouded Fable","date":"2024-08-02","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"78","artist":"Whisker","img":"sv6pt5/78"},{"id":"sv10-150","name":"Team Rocket's Persian ex","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"150","artist":null,"img":"sv10/150"},{"id":"sv10-219","name":"Team Rocket's Persian ex","set":"Des